</bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A shaft lock device, comprising a rotated member (2) having a pivot shaft (1) passing therethrough in the state of free rotation and elastic pressing members (3, 4) having the pivot shaft (1) passing therethrough in the state of restricted rotation and holding a relative angle between the rotated member (2) and the pivot shaft (1) at any angle by the application of a pressure to the rotated member (2), wherein an inclination angle between the pivot shaft and the rotated member can be adjusted with a stable frictional torque, and a structure thereof can be simplified.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un dispositif d'arrêt pour essieu, qui comprend un élément en rotation (2) composé d'un arbre de pivot (1) le traversant en état de libre rotation, et des éléments presseurs élastiques (3, 4) qui sont traversés par l'arbre de pivot (1) en état de rotation limitée, et qui décrivent un angle relatif entre l'élément en rotation (2) et l'arbre de pivot (1), selon un angle quelconque, par l'application d'une pression sur l'élément en rotation (2). On peut ainsi ajuster un angle d'inclinaison entre l'arbre de pivot et l'élément en rotation au moyen d'un couple de friction stable, et simplifier la structure du dispositif.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>